-block-540","rulesync/Explanation/Rulesync authenticates to GitHub with GITHUB_TOKEN",["Filed"]],["2026-10-19%20Mon/","source-block-619","Updated",[]],["2026-10-19%20Mon/","source-block-635","Logseq/Entity/Definition",["Updated"]],["2026-10-19%20Mon/","source-block-667","Logseq/Entity/Proxy/Page",["Updated"]],["2026-10-19%20Mon/","source-block-699","GitP/How To/Prepare Podcast Metadata",["Updated"]],["2026-10-19%20Mon/","source-block-743","Logseq/Entity/Proxy/Page/mise/Task/sync",["Updated"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-0","Filed",[]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-14","My/AI/Rule/Factory Preset",["Filed"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-47","GitP/A/Session/26/10/20-Tue",["Filed"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-82","GitP/Acolyte",["Filed"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-102","Claude/Artifact/Q/Is it possible to pass query parameters to a Claude artifact and use them in the claude artifact?",["Filed"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-225","Claude/Artifact/Q/How much storage comes with Claude artifacts?",["Filed"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-296","Claude/Artifact/Q/How can I find my storage quota for Claude artifacts on seat-based Enterprise?",["Filed"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-400","Claude/Cowork/Q/Can each hackathon team share one API key through Claude Enterprise connectors, and how does ChatGPT secrets management differ?",["Filed"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-551","Updated",[]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-567","GitP/A/Session/26/10/18-Sun",["Updated"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-602","Microfreak/Preset/077 Eonz",["Updated"]],["2026-10-20%20Tue/","source-block-636","ChatGPT/Sites/Q/To what extent is it possible, either using Claude artifacts or using ChatGPT sites, to have a database that backs the site?",["Updated"]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-0","My Thoughts",[]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-20","I intend to use local mounts backed by Backblaze/B2 for assets, with relative local paths in garden source pages. At publish time, both the Logseq site pipeline and GitP/A's publishing pipeline should transform those paths into stable Cloudflare CDN URLs in the published output, including episode pages and RSS media enclosures.",["My Thoughts"]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-361","TIL",[]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-371","In Claude Enterprise, a private project can include data imported from a GitHub repository, but in my org an org-wide project has that option disabled. It looks like a one-time import, and I haven't found an easy way to refresh it yet, though I haven't tried. See Claude/Project/Explanation/How the GitHub integration feeds project knowledge and the official Use the GitHub integration article.",["TIL"]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-851","Filed",[]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-865","Cloudflare/D1",["Filed"]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-886","Cloudflare/R2",["Filed"]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-907","Cloudflare/R2/Concept/Pricing Compared with Backblaze B2",["Filed"]],["2026-10-21%20Wed/","source-block-971","Claude/Project/Explanation/How the GitHub integration feeds project knowledge",["Filed"]]],"format_version":5}